governor turn 1: plan -> commands  (The only failure is my acceptance-test assertion that list() hides completed todos by default. A pure rename should not change behaviour, and the existing unit tests (which pass) don't specify that filtering. So I'm replacing the over-specified acceptance test instead of forcing a behaviour change.)
